This is an original Rust implementation. Its protocol behavior (Google OAuth
installed-app flow, the Code Assist v1internal API, and the agent/tool loop)
was derived by studying the source of:

  google-gemini/gemini-cli
  https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli
  Copyright 2025 Google LLC
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

No gemini-cli source code is included. The behavior was reimplemented, and the
system prompt and tool descriptions are AntiCraft's own text. See PROTOCOL.md
for the referenced behavior and source paths.

You may obtain a copy of the Apache License, Version 2.0 at
  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The protocol behavior of the Antigravity, Codex and Claude Code sign-in flows
(Customizations > Account) was studied from:

  router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI
  https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI
  Licensed under the MIT License

No CLIProxyAPI source code is included. The flows were reimplemented.

Icons: Phosphor Icons (Regular), assets/Phosphor-Regular.ttf, from
https://phosphoricons.com via the egui-phosphor crate. MIT License,
see assets/Phosphor-LICENSE-MIT.txt. No Google logos or images are included.
